{'heading': 'Elm Quay gains one view of repair reports', 'words': 8, 'characters': 41}
{'paragraph_words': 34, 'paragraph': 'Elm Quay Housing kept telephone reporting open while testing a new log in two buildings. This case, published by Svale Systems, follows the maintenance team’s decisions, the trial figures, and the supervisor’s qualified assessment.'}
{'paragraph_words': 39, 'paragraph': 'Telephone reports and emails had been stored separately at Elm Quay Housing, which manages 640 apartments. In September 2025, its maintenance team decided to trial a shared repair log so staff on different shifts could see the same information.'}
{'heading': 'Elm Quay keeps telephone reporting open', 'words': 6, 'characters': 39}
{'paragraph_words': 24, 'paragraph': 'Before choosing Svale Systems, the team tested whether the log could show the status of each repair. No comparison with another supplier is available.'}
{'paragraph_words': 24, 'paragraph': 'The maintenance team designed the categories and kept telephone reporting open for residents. Svale configured the log and trained six staff in two sessions.'}
{'paragraph_words': 35, 'paragraph': 'Maintenance supervisor Maya Lind described the preparation in an email interview: “We spent more time agreeing on the categories than entering the first reports. I would set that time aside before the next building starts.”'}
{'heading': 'The trial note limits what the numbers show', 'words': 8, 'characters': 43}
{'paragraph_words': 28, 'paragraph': 'Elm Quay’s internal trial note, dated December 4, 2025, records 31 repair reports entered during the eight-week trial. That count excludes emergencies and work ordered before the trial.'}
{'paragraph_words': 49, 'paragraph': 'Median time from report to assignment was two working days during the trial, compared with three in the preceding eight-week period. The periods had different workloads, and the note explicitly does not attribute the difference to the software. There are no cost, resident satisfaction, or repair completion time measurements.'}
{'heading': 'Maya Lind assesses the experience', 'words': 5, 'characters': 33}
{'paragraph_words': 19, 'paragraph': 'The trial has not yet expanded. The team will decide after checking how its categories work for larger repairs.'}
{'paragraph_words': 32, 'paragraph': 'Lind’s assessment in the email interview was: “I would choose to do the trial again. Having one view of the reports helps us, but I would leave an extra week for preparation.”'}
{'heading': 'Other teams can weigh Elm Quay’s experience', 'words': 7, 'characters': 43}
{'paragraph_words': 17, 'paragraph': 'For operations managers considering a similar trial, the [implementation checklist](https://example.invalid/svale/checklist) is an optional next step to read.'}
